   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Krea 2 Turbo img2img with up to 3 style references\n\n**SOURCE image** (red) is what gets re-rendered; it also sets the output size (scaled to ~1 MP, multiple of 16).\n\n**Denoise** on the red Scheduler node is the img2img strength:\n- `0.35` to `0.5`: keep composition, re-render texture/lighting toward the references.\n- `0.6` (default): same subject and layout, freer re-interpretation.\n- `1.0`: ignore the source content entirely (pure reference-guided generation; source only sets the size).\n\n**References 1 to 3** steer look, palette, lighting and rendering style through reference latents (`index_timestep_zero`). Reference 2 / 3 are bypassed: select and press **Ctrl+B** to enable. Use references that share a style; mismatched ones produce split compositions. Not an identity/face lock.\n\nThe **Style Reference LoRA** (ostris, 1.0) is what makes Krea 2 read the references; keep it on. **Realistic Snapshot** is stacked at 1.0 (bypass if it fights the references).\n\nKrea 2 Turbo: 8 steps, cfg 1, euler / simple, shift 1.15."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "Notes"
  }
